Package: miaoseq
Title: MiaoSeq — CRISPR Edit Analysis from Indexed Nanopore Amplicon Sequencing
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-07-03
Authors@R: 
    person("Tomoyuki", "Furuta", , "f.tomoyuki@okayama-u.ac.jp", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: MiaoSeq analyzes multiplexed indexed amplicon Oxford Nanopore
    sequencing (MIAOseq) data to characterize CRISPR-Cas genome editing
    outcomes. The package provides two complementary workflows: a legacy
    read-level pipeline (basecalling, BLAST demultiplexing, alignment, and
    edit calling via miaoEditcall), and a refless cluster-consensus pipeline
    (doDemultiplex2, per-sample clustering, pileup consensus, confidence
    metrics, optional chimera detection, and consensus-based edit calling via
    doEditCalling). Utilities include plate-level result visualization
    (editViewer), run quality reporting (writeReflessReport), and index-set
    design evaluation (evaluateIndexSet).
